<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Nov central bank reserves $9.8 bln.</title>
<headline>Hungary Nov central bank reserves $9.8 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's central bank reserves stood at $9.8 billion at the end of November, compared to $10.1 billion at the end of October, the National Bank of Hungary said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>NOTE - The NBH values gold at London market prices.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
